The following issues have been fixed in this update:

 Bug with getting AK from Petrovich. Now Petrovich gives AK. The fee is also reduced to 18 bottles of vodka;
 Bug with getting the "Bottle man" achievement;
 Bug with getting the "Frozen killer" achievement;
        Bug with getting the "Rocketman " achievement;
 Bug with falling objects under textures.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39903166/acbe2686b64fe9eda6de765691d9c45f43003326.png
Small but important fixes and changes:

 Fixed a bug with closing the passage to the neighbor, the neighbor's dog;
 Fixed a bug with the ability to walk during the initial cut scene;
 Fixed bugs in the mission "Bring uranium to a neighbor";
 Increased walking speed (when carrying objects or walking with weapons);
 Adjusted running speed.

Although the game is not a shooter, but the action in the description of the game is stated. Therefore, there should be an interesting shooting mechanics.
To avoid reading too much, here is a video with a demonstration:
[previewyoutube=8wdiH7L63j0;full][/previewyoutube]
[previewyoutube=wSnQsv0kiTM;full][/previewyoutube]

Features:

[ * ] Implemented a spread when shooting, and each type of weapon has its own (the sawn-off shotgun has a much higher spread than the rifle);
Each weapon has its own damage;
Each weapon has its own rate of fire;
 The shotgun and sawn-off shotgun have full-fledged shotgun shooting (for example, the enemy can be hit with one shotgun), and when shooting from them, 2 rounds are spent.


But since the game is not a shooter, some restrictions and simplifications have been added. For example:

 For all weapons, 1 type of ammo "Universal" is used;
[ * ] You can not carry and use several types of weapons, if you pick up a new one, then the old one is thrown out;
